# Diva ttyds answer init for ISDN PPP, controller 4, number 7950, profile 9.
# TTY profile 9 per divas4linux AT.txt: HDLC/transparent, the stack used for PPP.
# Profile 9 switches to ATV0 numeric and ATE0 by default (AT.txt note [b]),
# so nothing is expected back from AT&F9: ATV1E0 is sent blind to restore
# verbose replies before the rest of the init.
ABORT 'ERROR'
TIMEOUT 5
'' '\dAT&F9'
'' '\dATV1E0'
OK 'AT+iQ=a4'
OK 'AT+iA7950'
OK 'ATS0=1'
REPORT CONNECT
TIMEOUT 86400
CONNECT '\c'
'\n' '\c'
